    "text": "Back\nCOLOSSEUM · TANKOBAN\nMANGA  ·  TANKOBAN\nOne Piece\nAdd to Collections\nEiichiro Oda\nPublishing\n1997\n★ 9.22\n107 volumes · 3 on this device\nAction\nAdventure\nFantasy\n\nMonkey D. Luffy sets sail in pursuit of the legendary treasure known as One Piece. With the Straw Hat Pirates, he crosses treacherous seas, meets unlikely allies, and challenges powerful enemies on the way to becoming King of the Pirates. Along the Grand Line and into the New World, every island brings new friendships and an adventure of its own.\n\nMore\nTankoban Mode\nChapter Mode\nLanguage\nEnglish\nON THIS DEVICE\n3 OF 107\nVOLUMES\n107\nSelect\nVOL 1\nRomance Dawn\nVOL 2\nBuggy the Clown\nVOL 3\nDon't Get Fooled Again\nContinue · p. 78\nVOL 4\nThe Black Cat Pirates\nVOL 5\nFor Whom the Bell Tolls\nVOL 6\nThe Oath\nVOL 7\nThe Crap-Geezer\nVOL 8\nI Won't Die\nVOL 9\nTears\nVOL 10\nOK, Let's Stand Up!\nVol. 3\nDon't Get Fooled Again\n↓  Download\nContinue Vol. 3",
